    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I haven't seen you before. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я не бачив вас раніше. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>You know, we have a very rich mine here.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Знаєте, у нас тут дуже багата шахта.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Someone whacked Balor, the Ironhead leader. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Хтось забив Балора, лідера Залізних голів. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>::Yawns.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Зеває.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>My hands are covered in calluses.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Мої руки вкриті мозолями.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>You look familiar... like I've seen you on a screen somewhere...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ви виглядаєте знайомо... ніби я бачив вас десь на екрані...::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Do you smell something?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ви щось відчуваєте?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Statistically speaking, Foundry has the highest mortality rate in the whole Lower Underrail. That makes me really worried.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Статистично кажучи, Foundry має найвищий рівень смертності у всьому Нижньому Андеррейлі. Це мене дуже турбує.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Some folks say Old Mike was killed and eaten by some people from the slums. Nasty!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Дехто каже, що Старий Майк був убитий і з’їдений людьми з нетрів. Огидно!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I heard some $(#guy/chick) from the outside helped the Foundry Guard fight the rock creatures. Boss. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я чув, що $(#хлопець/дівчина) ззовні допоміг охороні Foundry боротися з кам’яними істотами. Бос. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Why would the Faceless attack us? I don't understand... ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чому Безликі напали на нас? Я не розумію... ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q14" name="=&gt;q14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>How could the Foundry Guard have allowed that sniper attack?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Як охорона Foundry могла дозволити цей снайперський напад?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
